msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr ""

msgid "compatible: the block runs before podkop (priority -170 vs -150), console traffic to update servers never reaches the proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid "compatible: dropped packets never reach zapret queues."
msgstr ""

msgid "compatible: works as dnsmasq upstream; the dnsmasq block answers first."
msgstr ""

msgid "if it replaces dnsmasq on port 53, add the update domains to its blocklist."
